no. several things happened here:

the toxic waste only caused a self-polymorph (you into snake).

during the time that you were a snake or perhaps just prior to that time
you got the "warning" attribute. many, if not all, characters get this
upon acquiring experience level 15 ("you feel sensitive"). the glow
corresponds, i believe, to proximity to various monster types.

subsequently, you stepped on a (one-time-effective) polymorph trap
which poinked you into an orc mummy.

there's not much you can do (or want to do) about the glow. a ring of
polymorph control will be useful for self-polymorphs ...

